('general', 'What is HOME AFRICA', 'HOME AFRICA is a comprehensive real estate platform that helps you find apartments, houses, cars, and land plots in Rwanda and across Africa. We connect buyers with verified sellers and provide a trusted marketplace for property transactions.', ARRAY['what is home africa', 'home africa', 'what is this', 'platform'], 10, 'en'),
('general', 'What does HOME AFRICA do', 'HOME AFRICA is a real estate platform that helps you find and connect with properties including apartments, houses, cars, and land plots. We also connect you with driving schools. Our platform makes property searching easy and reliable.', ARRAY['what does home africa do', 'what do you do', 'services', 'what is this platform'], 10, 'en'),
('general', 'What can you help me with', 'I''m Rejo AI, and I can help you: find apartments, houses, cars, and land plots; answer questions about our services; guide you through booking viewings; provide property information; and assist with general real estate questions. What do you need help with?', ARRAY['help', 'what', 'can', 'do', 'assist', 'what can you do'], 10, 'en'),
('general', 'What services do you offer', 'HOME AFRICA offers a platform to find apartments, houses, cars, and land plots. We also connect you with driving schools. I can help you search for properties, answer questions, guide you through bookings, and provide real estate information. What can I help you with?', ARRAY['services', 'offer', 'what', 'do', 'what services'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'What can Rejo AI do', 'I''m Rejo AI! I can help you search for properties (apartments, houses, cars, land), answer questions about listings, guide you through bookings, provide real estate information, and assist with general questions. What would you like help with?', ARRAY['what can rejo ai do', 'what can you do', 'rejo ai', 'capabilities'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'Who are you', 'I''m Rejo AI, your intelligent assistant for HOME AFRICA. I help you find properties, answer questions, and guide you through our platform. How can I assist you today?', ARRAY['who are you', 'what are you', 'introduction'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'What are you', 'I''m Rejo AI, an AI assistant created to help you navigate HOME AFRICA. I can help you find properties, answer questions, and provide information about real estate. What can I help you with?', ARRAY['what are you', 'who are you'], 8, 'en'),
('general', 'Help', 'I''m here to help! I can assist you with finding properties, answering questions, or guiding you through our services. What do you need help with?', ARRAY['help', 'assist', 'support', 'need help'], 10, 'en'),
('general', 'I need help', 'I''m Rejo AI, and I''m here to help! I can help you find apartments, houses, cars, or land plots. I can also answer questions about our services. What do you need?', ARRAY['need help', 'help', 'assistance', 'support'], 10, 'en'),
('general', 'Can you help me', 'Absolutely! I''m Rejo AI, and I''m here to help. I can assist with finding properties, answering questions, booking viewings, and more. What do you need help with?', ARRAY['can you help', 'help me', 'assist me'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'How does HOME AFRICA work', 'HOME AFRICA works as a marketplace connecting property seekers with sellers. You can browse listings by category (apartments, cars, land), filter by location and price, view property details, book viewings, and contact sellers directly. I can help guide you through the process!', ARRAY['how does it work', 'how it works', 'how to use', 'process'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'How do I use HOME AFRICA', 'Using HOME AFRICA is easy! Browse listings by category, use filters to narrow your search, click on properties to see details, book viewings, and contact sellers. I can help you search for specific properties or answer any questions you have!', ARRAY['how to use', 'how do i use', 'tutorial', 'guide'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'Is HOME AFRICA free', 'Yes, browsing and searching properties on HOME AFRICA is free! You can view listings, search properties, and contact sellers at no cost. Some premium features may have fees, but basic property searching is completely free.', ARRAY['free', 'cost', 'price', 'fee', 'is it free'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'Do I need to pay to use HOME AFRICA', 'No, you don''t need to pay to browse and search properties on HOME AFRICA. Viewing listings, searching, and contacting sellers is free. Some optional premium features may have fees, but basic usage is free.', ARRAY['pay', 'payment', 'free', 'cost', 'fee'], 8, 'en'),
('general', 'How do I contact HOME AFRICA', 'You can contact HOME AFRICA through our website contact page, or I can help answer your questions right here! For specific inquiries, check our website footer for contact information. What do you need help with?', ARRAY['contact', 'how to contact', 'support', 'email', 'phone'], 8, 'en'),
('general', 'Where is HOME AFRICA located', 'HOME AFRICA operates in Rwanda and across Africa. Our platform features properties throughout Rwanda, with many listings in Kigali and other major cities. You can filter listings by location to find properties in your area.', ARRAY['where', 'location', 'located', 'address', 'office'], 8, 'en'),
('general', 'Is HOME AFRICA trustworthy', 'Yes! HOME AFRICA is a trusted platform that connects buyers with verified sellers. We work to ensure reliable listings and provide a safe marketplace for property transactions. Always verify details with sellers before making commitments.', ARRAY['trustworthy', 'trust', 'reliable', 'safe', 'legitimate'], 8, 'en'),
('general', 'How long has HOME AFRICA been operating', 'HOME AFRICA is committed to providing quality real estate services. Our platform connects property seekers with sellers across Rwanda and Africa. I can help you find properties or answer questions about our services!', ARRAY['how long', 'history', 'established', 'when started'], 7, 'en'),
('general', 'What makes HOME AFRICA different', 'HOME AFRICA offers a comprehensive platform for apartments, houses, cars, and land plots all in one place. We provide easy search, filtering, and direct contact with sellers. Plus, I''m here 24/7 to help you find what you need!', ARRAY['different', 'unique', 'special', 'why choose'], 7, 'en'),

