('listings', 'How much do apartments cost', 'Apartment prices vary depending on location, size, and amenities. Prices range from affordable options to premium properties. You can filter by price range on our Apartments page. What''s your budget?', ARRAY['price', 'cost', 'how much', 'apartments', 'pricing'], 10, 'en'),
('listings', 'What are your prices', 'Prices vary depending on the type of property and location. You can browse our listings and use filters to find properties within your budget. What type of property are you looking for?', ARRAY['price', 'prices', 'cost', 'how much'], 10, 'en'),
('listings', 'How much do houses cost', 'House prices vary based on location, size, condition, and amenities. Prices range from affordable to luxury properties. Check our Apartments page and use price filters to find houses in your budget. What price range are you considering?', ARRAY['house price', 'house cost', 'how much houses', 'house pricing'], 9, 'en'),
('listings', 'How much do cars cost', 'Car prices vary widely based on make, model, year, condition, and mileage. You can filter cars by price range on our Cars page. What''s your budget?', ARRAY['car price', 'car cost', 'how much cars', 'car pricing'], 9, 'en'),
('listings', 'How much does land cost', 'Land prices vary significantly by location, size, and development potential. Prime locations in Kigali tend to be more expensive. Check our Land Plots page and use filters to find land in your price range. What area are you interested in?', ARRAY['land price', 'land cost', 'how much land', 'land pricing'], 9, 'en'),
('listings', 'What is the average price of apartments', 'Apartment prices vary widely. In Kigali, you can find apartments ranging from affordable options to luxury properties. Prices depend on location, size, and amenities. Use our price filters to find apartments in your budget range.', ARRAY['average price', 'apartment price', 'typical price'], 8, 'en'),
('listings', 'What is the cheapest apartment', 'We have apartments at various price points. Use our Apartments page and sort by price to find the most affordable options. You can also set a maximum price filter. What''s your budget?', ARRAY['cheapest', 'affordable', 'lowest price', 'budget'], 8, 'en'),
('listings', 'What is the most expensive property', 'We have properties across all price ranges, from affordable to luxury. Premium properties typically feature prime locations, larger sizes, and premium amenities. What type of property are you interested in?', ARRAY['expensive', 'luxury', 'premium', 'high end'], 7, 'en'),
('listings', 'Can I negotiate the price', 'Price negotiation is typically done directly with the seller. Once you find a property you''re interested in, you can contact the seller to discuss pricing. I can help you find properties and guide you through contacting sellers.', ARRAY['negotiate', 'discount', 'bargain', 'haggle'], 8, 'en'),
('listings', 'Are prices negotiable', 'Price negotiation depends on the individual seller. Some sellers may be open to negotiation, especially for long-term rentals or cash purchases. Contact the seller directly to discuss. Would you like help finding a property?', ARRAY['negotiable', 'discount', 'bargain'], 8, 'en'),
('listings', 'Do you offer payment plans', 'Payment terms are typically arranged directly with the seller. Some sellers may offer payment plans for property purchases. Contact the seller to discuss payment options. I can help you find properties that match your needs.', ARRAY['payment plan', 'installments', 'financing', 'loan'], 7, 'en'),
('listings', 'What payment methods do you accept', 'Payment methods vary by seller. Common methods include bank transfers, mobile money, and cash. Contact the seller directly to discuss payment options. I can help you find properties and connect with sellers.', ARRAY['payment method', 'how to pay', 'payment options'], 7, 'en'),
('listings', 'Is there a deposit required', 'Deposit requirements vary by property and seller. Some rentals may require a security deposit, while property purchases may require a down payment. Contact the seller for specific deposit requirements.', ARRAY['deposit', 'down payment', 'security deposit'], 7, 'en'),

