('apartments', 'What types of apartments do you have', 'We have various apartment types including studio apartments, one-bedroom, two-bedroom, three-bedroom, and larger units. You can filter by number of bedrooms on our Apartments page. What size are you looking for?', ARRAY['apartment types', 'kinds of apartments', 'apartment sizes'], 10, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Do you have studio apartments', 'Yes! We have studio apartments available. Studio apartments are great for individuals or couples. Check our Apartments page and filter for studio or one-bedroom units. What location are you interested in?', ARRAY['studio', 'studio apartment', 'efficiency'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Do you have one bedroom apartments', 'Yes! We have one-bedroom apartments available. One-bedroom apartments are perfect for individuals or couples. Browse our Apartments page and filter by bedrooms. What area are you looking in?', ARRAY['one bedroom', '1 bedroom', '1br', 'single bedroom'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Do you have two bedroom apartments', 'Yes! We have many two-bedroom apartments available. Two-bedroom apartments are great for small families or roommates. Check our Apartments page and use the bedroom filter. What location interests you?', ARRAY['two bedroom', '2 bedroom', '2br', 'double bedroom'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Do you have three bedroom apartments', 'Yes! We have three-bedroom apartments available. Three-bedroom apartments are ideal for families. Browse our Apartments page and filter by bedrooms. What area are you considering?', ARRAY['three bedroom', '3 bedroom', '3br'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Do you have furnished apartments', 'Yes! Many of our apartments come furnished. You can check individual listings for furniture details. Furnished apartments typically include basic furniture and appliances. What are you looking for?', ARRAY['furnished', 'furniture', 'with furniture'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Do you have unfurnished apartments', 'Yes! We have both furnished and unfurnished apartments available. Check individual listings for details. Unfurnished apartments give you the freedom to decorate as you like. What type are you looking for?', ARRAY['unfurnished', 'without furniture', 'empty'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'What amenities do apartments have', 'Apartment amenities vary by property. Common amenities include parking, security, water, electricity, internet, balconies, and sometimes gyms or pools. Check individual listings for specific amenities. What amenities are important to you?', ARRAY['amenities', 'features', 'facilities', 'what included'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Do apartments have parking', 'Many apartments include parking spaces. Check individual listings for parking availability. Some apartments have dedicated parking, while others may have street parking. What are your parking needs?', ARRAY['parking', 'car park', 'parking space'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Do apartments have security', 'Many apartments include security features like gated compounds, security guards, or security systems. Check individual listings for security details. Security is an important consideration for many renters.', ARRAY['security', 'guards', 'gated', 'safe'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Are utilities included in rent', 'Utility inclusion varies by apartment. Some apartments include water and electricity in the rent, while others require separate payment. Check individual listings for utility details. What are you looking for?', ARRAY['utilities', 'water', 'electricity', 'included'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'How much is rent for apartments', 'Rent varies widely based on location, size, and amenities. In Kigali, rents can range from affordable to premium. Use our price filters on the Apartments page to find rentals in your budget. What''s your budget?', ARRAY['rent', 'rental price', 'monthly rent', 'how much rent'], 10, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Are apartments for rent or sale', 'We have apartments available for both rent and sale. Check individual listings to see if they''re for rent or sale. You can also filter by your preference. Are you looking to rent or buy?', ARRAY['rent', 'sale', 'buy', 'rental', 'purchase'], 10, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Can I rent an apartment', 'Yes! Many apartments are available for rent. Browse our Apartments page to see rental listings. You can filter by location, price, and number of bedrooms. What are you looking for?', ARRAY['rent', 'rental', 'lease'], 10, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Can I buy an apartment', 'Yes! Some apartments are available for purchase. Check our Apartments page and look for sale listings. You can contact sellers directly to discuss purchase details. What type of apartment are you interested in?', ARRAY['buy', 'purchase', 'sale'], 10, 'en'),
('apartments', 'How do I apply for an apartment', 'To apply for an apartment, view the listing details and contact the seller directly. The seller will guide you through their application process, which may include providing references, proof of income, and a deposit. I can help you find apartments!', ARRAY['apply', 'application', 'how to apply'], 8, 'en'),
('apartments', 'What documents do I need to rent', 'Document requirements vary by landlord, but typically include: ID, proof of income, references, and sometimes a deposit. Contact the seller directly for their specific requirements. I can help you find apartments!', ARRAY['documents', 'requirements', 'what needed', 'papers'], 8, 'en'),
('apartments', 'How long is the lease period', 'Lease periods vary by landlord. Common lease terms are 6 months, 1 year, or 2 years. Some landlords offer flexible terms. Contact the seller to discuss lease duration. What are you looking for?', ARRAY['lease', 'contract', 'duration', 'how long'], 8, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Can I get a short term rental', 'Some apartments may be available for short-term rentals. Check individual listings or contact sellers directly to discuss short-term options. What duration are you looking for?', ARRAY['short term', 'temporary', 'monthly'], 7, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Are pets allowed', 'Pet policies vary by apartment and landlord. Some apartments allow pets, while others don''t. Check individual listings or contact the seller to ask about pet policies. Do you have pets?', ARRAY['pets', 'dogs', 'cats', 'animals'], 8, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Are apartments near schools', 'Many apartments are located near schools. Use our location filters and check individual listings for nearby amenities. What area are you interested in?', ARRAY['schools', 'education', 'near school'], 7, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Are apartments near hospitals', 'Many apartments are located near hospitals and medical facilities. Check individual listings for nearby amenities. What area are you considering?', ARRAY['hospitals', 'medical', 'healthcare', 'near hospital'], 7, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Are apartments near shopping centers', 'Many apartments are located near shopping centers and markets. Check individual listings for nearby amenities. What area interests you?', ARRAY['shopping', 'markets', 'malls', 'stores'], 7, 'en'),
('apartments', 'What is the best area for apartments', 'The best area depends on your needs - proximity to work, schools, budget, and lifestyle preferences. Popular areas in Kigali include Nyarutarama, Kimisagara, Remera, and others. What are your priorities?', ARRAY['best area', 'good location', 'recommended'], 8, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Are there apartments in Nyarutarama', 'Yes! We have apartments in Nyarutarama. Nyarutarama is a popular area in Kigali. Check our Apartments page and filter by location. What size apartment are you looking for?', ARRAY['nyarutarama', 'location'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Are there apartments in Kimisagara', 'Yes! We have apartments in Kimisagara. Kimisagara is a well-located area in Kigali. Browse our Apartments page and use location filters. What are you looking for?', ARRAY['kimisagara', 'location'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Are there apartments in Remera', 'Yes! We have apartments in Remera. Remera is a popular area in Kigali. Check our Apartments page and filter by Remera. What type of apartment do you need?', ARRAY['remera', 'location'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Are there apartments in Gasabo', 'Yes! We have apartments in Gasabo district. Gasabo is one of Kigali''s districts with many residential options. Browse our Apartments page and filter by location. What are you looking for?', ARRAY['gasabo', 'district'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Are there apartments in Kicukiro', 'Yes! We have apartments in Kicukiro district. Kicukiro offers various residential options. Check our Apartments page and use location filters. What size apartment do you need?', ARRAY['kicukiro', 'district'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Are there apartments in Nyarugenge', 'Yes! We have apartments in Nyarugenge district. Nyarugenge is centrally located in Kigali. Browse our Apartments page and filter by location. What are your preferences?', ARRAY['nyarugenge', 'district'], 9, 'en'),

