('apartments', '3 bedroom apartment', 'Yes! We have three-bedroom apartments available. Three-bedroom apartments are ideal for families. Check our Apartments page and filter by bedrooms. What area are you considering?', ARRAY['3 bedroom', 'three bedroom', '3br'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', '4 bedroom apartment', 'Yes! We have larger apartments including four-bedroom units. Larger apartments suit bigger families. Browse our Apartments page and filter by bedrooms. What are your preferences?', ARRAY['4 bedroom', 'four bedroom', '4br'], 8, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Furnished apartment for rent', 'Yes! We have furnished apartments available for rent. Furnished apartments include furniture and are move-in ready. Check our Apartments page and look for furnished listings. What location are you interested in?', ARRAY['furnished', 'rent', 'furniture'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Unfurnished apartment', 'Yes! We have unfurnished apartments available. Unfurnished apartments let you bring your own furniture. Browse our Apartments page. Both furnished and unfurnished options are available. What do you prefer?', ARRAY['unfurnished', 'empty', 'no furniture'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Apartment with parking', 'Yes! Many apartments include parking spaces. Check individual listings for parking availability. Some have dedicated parking, others street parking. Browse our Apartments page. What are your parking needs?', ARRAY['parking', 'car park', 'parking space'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Apartment with balcony', 'Yes! Many apartments have balconies. Balconies offer outdoor space and views. Check individual listings for balcony availability. Browse our Apartments page. What features are important to you?', ARRAY['balcony', 'terrace', 'outdoor space'], 8, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Apartment with security', 'Yes! Many apartments include security features like gated compounds or security guards. Security is important for many renters. Check individual listings for security details. Browse our Apartments page. What area interests you?', ARRAY['security', 'guards', 'gated', 'safe'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Apartment utilities included', 'Some apartments include utilities (water, electricity) in rent, others require separate payment. Check individual listings for utility details. Browse our Apartments page. What are you looking for?', ARRAY['utilities', 'included', 'water', 'electricity'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Pet friendly apartment', 'Pet policies vary by apartment and landlord. Some apartments allow pets, others don''t. Check individual listings or contact sellers about pet policies. Browse our Apartments page. Do you have pets?', ARRAY['pets', 'pet friendly', 'dogs', 'cats'], 8, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Apartment near school', 'Yes! Many apartments are located near schools, which is convenient for families. Use location filters on our Apartments page. Check individual listings for nearby amenities. What area are you interested in?', ARRAY['near school', 'school', 'education'], 8, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Apartment near hospital', 'Yes! Many apartments are located near hospitals and medical facilities. Use location filters on our Apartments page. Medical proximity is convenient for healthcare access. What area are you considering?', ARRAY['near hospital', 'hospital', 'medical'], 7, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Apartment near market', 'Yes! Many apartments are located near markets and shopping areas. Use location filters on our Apartments page. Shopping proximity offers convenience. What area interests you?', ARRAY['near market', 'market', 'shopping'], 7, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Cheap apartment for rent', 'Yes! We have affordable apartments available. Use our Apartments page and filter by price or sort by lowest price. Budget-friendly options are available. What''s your budget?', ARRAY['cheap', 'affordable', 'budget', 'rent'], 9, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Luxury apartment', 'Yes! We have luxury apartments available. Premium apartments feature prime locations, larger sizes, and premium amenities. Check our Apartments page and filter by price. What are you looking for?', ARRAY['luxury', 'premium', 'high end'], 8, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Modern apartment', 'Yes! We have modern apartments with contemporary designs and amenities. Modern apartments often feature updated kitchens, bathrooms, and finishes. Browse our Apartments page. What style interests you?', ARRAY['modern', 'contemporary', 'updated'], 8, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Spacious apartment', 'Yes! We have spacious apartments available. Larger apartments offer more room for families. Check our Apartments page and filter by size or bedrooms. What size do you need?', ARRAY['spacious', 'large', 'big', 'roomy'], 8, 'en'),
('apartments', 'Small apartment', 'Yes! We have smaller apartments including studios and one-bedrooms. Small apartments are affordable and efficient. Browse our Apartments page. What size are you looking for?', ARRAY['small', 'compact', 'efficient'], 8, 'en'),

