('general', 'How do I browse', 'To browse properties, visit our website and click on any category - Apartments, Cars, or Land. Each page shows all available listings with filters. What type of property interests you?', ARRAY['how do i', 'browse', 'view'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'How do I filter', 'To filter properties, use the filter options on each category page. You can filter by location, price, size, and other criteria. Filters help narrow your search. What are you looking for?', ARRAY['how do i', 'filter', 'narrow'], 8, 'en'),
('general', 'How do I contact sellers', 'To contact sellers, view the property listing details where you''ll find contact information. You can call, email, or use our messaging system. Sellers will respond to your inquiries. What property interests you?', ARRAY['how do i', 'contact', 'sellers'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'How do I save favorites', 'To save favorite properties, create an account and log in. When viewing listings, you can save favorites for easy access later. Registration is free and quick. Would you like to sign up?', ARRAY['how do i', 'save', 'favorites'], 8, 'en'),
('general', 'How do I get started', 'To get started, browse our website by category - Apartments, Cars, or Land. Use filters to find what you need, view listings, and contact sellers. I can help guide you! What are you looking for?', ARRAY['how do i', 'get started', 'begin'], 9, 'en'),

-- "What is" variations for common terms
('general', 'What is a studio', 'A studio apartment is a small apartment with a single main room combining living, sleeping, and kitchen areas, with a separate bathroom. Studios are affordable and perfect for individuals. We have studios available!', ARRAY['what is', 'studio', 'apartment type'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'What is a bedroom', 'A bedroom is a room used for sleeping. Properties are described by number of bedrooms - 1BR (one bedroom), 2BR (two bedrooms), etc. More bedrooms typically mean higher rent or price. How many bedrooms do you need?', ARRAY['what is', 'bedroom', 'br'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'What is rent', 'Rent is regular payment made to a landlord for using property. Rent is typically paid monthly. We have many properties available for rent. What type of property are you looking to rent?', ARRAY['what is', 'rent', 'rental'], 10, 'en'),
('general', 'What is a deposit', 'A deposit is money paid upfront when renting or buying property. For rentals, it''s typically a security deposit. For purchases, it''s a down payment. Deposits vary by property and seller. What property interests you?', ARRAY['what is', 'deposit', 'down payment'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'What is a lease', 'A lease is a legal contract between landlord and tenant for renting property. It specifies rent amount, duration, and terms. Leases protect both parties. Always read leases carefully before signing.', ARRAY['what is', 'lease', 'rental agreement'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'What is a mortgage', 'A mortgage is a loan used to purchase property, with the property as collateral. Mortgages are paid over many years. Some sellers may work with mortgage providers. What property are you interested in?', ARRAY['what is', 'mortgage', 'loan'], 8, 'en'),
('general', 'What is a title', 'A title is legal proof of property ownership. Title deeds show who owns property and any restrictions. Always verify title before purchasing property. I can help you find properties!', ARRAY['what is', 'title', 'ownership'], 9, 'en'),
('general', 'What is an agent', 'A property agent (realtor) helps buyers and sellers with property transactions. Agents provide market knowledge and handle paperwork. Some sellers work with agents. What property are you looking for?', ARRAY['what is', 'agent', 'realtor'], 8, 'en'),

